{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02499",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.18,
      "end_seconds": 4.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.93,
      "end_seconds": 9.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.34,
      "end_seconds": 20.51,
      "duration_seconds": 10.17,
      "text": "It's blurred vision with halos, mostly. I've never really been one for hospitals. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.38,
      "end_seconds": 29.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.62,
      "end_seconds": 37.47,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "Ever since... since yesterday, really. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.41,
      "end_seconds": 42.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.16,
      "end_seconds": 58.41,
      "duration_seconds": 15.25,
      "text": "It usually comes with a severe painful red eye. The severe painful red eye? That's been for six months. With severe painful red eye, honestly, a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.64,
      "end_seconds": 62.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "So, I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.96,
      "end_seconds": 72.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.0,
      "end_seconds": 90.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 79, pressure 112 over 73, SpO2 99 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.92,
      "end_seconds": 96.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.42,
      "end_seconds": 99.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.71,
      "end_seconds": 121.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "The right eye is red, the pupil is fixed and mid-sized, and the eye feels rock hard."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.55,
      "end_seconds": 133.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. And what about contact lens, discharge or injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.34,
      "end_seconds": 138.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "None of those, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.17,
      "end_seconds": 143.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.79,
      "end_seconds": 147.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.45,
      "end_seconds": 152.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.63,
      "end_seconds": 157.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I'm allergic to grass pollen, I get sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.23,
      "end_seconds": 170.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.7,
      "end_seconds": 174.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.79,
      "end_seconds": 180.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.52,
      "end_seconds": 190.55,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "Let me think, I've had thin bones for about a year now. I've got acid reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.32,
      "end_seconds": 211.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.13,
      "end_seconds": 224.96,
      "duration_seconds": 11.83,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.56,
      "end_seconds": 230.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.8,
      "end_seconds": 238.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "I, I take pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast for my acidity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.47,
      "end_seconds": 243.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.4,
      "end_seconds": 249.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "For two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.2,
      "end_seconds": 255.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I'd lean towards acute angle-closure glaucoma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.52,
      "end_seconds": 259.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.67,
      "end_seconds": 271.63,
      "duration_seconds": 11.96,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's acute angle-closure glaucoma, and we'll know more once the an urgent eye pressure check is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.38,
      "end_seconds": 301.1,
      "duration_seconds": 10.72,
      "text": "I want an urgent eye pressure check done, that's for acute glaucoma. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.29,
      "end_seconds": 305.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}